1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We are Space Logistics, from Buenos Aires.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Before we land on the Moon or Mars,
we must test everything on Earth.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This is Planetary Twin AI:
finding the Moon and Mars on Earth.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Pick a world and a mission:
a landing site or a permanent base.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Choose what matters.
NASA data scores every place on Earth.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
It finds new analogs, and says what they test
and what Earth cannot reproduce.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Cheaper, closer test sites
for the next steps in space.
